OL,3,GNEWSAPolice chief says racists and
OL,4,Amisogynists working inside force
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe appeared in front of the Welsh
OL,7,FAffairs Committee on Wednesday, along
OL,8,Fwith Wales' three other police bosses,
OL,9,Fas part of its inquiry into the future
OL,10,Fof policing.
